{#-
  BLOCK: table — §06's `table`. Five columns: Address · Price · Bd / Ba ·
  Sq ft · Days.

  As Design's 5th package draws it: no brand fill on the header — 10.5px
  uppercase labels over a 2px ink rule — `tint` zebra rows, and the price
  column in `price_ink` (`primary_ink`, AA on white and on the tint), which is
  the only brand-coloured text in the table and carries `tr-brand` for dark
  mode. The header used to be the brand fill with `on_header` text; with no fill
  there is no text-on-brand to derive.

  Row values arrive formatted from `_sales_table_row`, where the fallbacks and
  the status palette are tested.
-#}
          <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:22px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
            {%- for h, align in [('Address','left'),('Price','right'),('Bd / Ba','right'),('Sq ft','right'),('Days','right')] %}<th align="{{ align }}" class="tr-muted" style="padding:8px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748B;border-bottom:2px solid #0F172A;">{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
            {%- for r in rows %}<tr>
              <td align="left" class="tr-ink{{ ' tr-tint' if r.zebra else '' }}" style="padding:9px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;background:{{ tint if r.zebra else 'transparent' }};border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;">{{ r.address }}{{ r.badge_html }}</td>
              <td align="right" class="tr-brand{{ ' tr-tint' if r.zebra else '' }}" style="padding:9px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:{{ price_ink }};background:{{ tint if r.zebra else 'transparent' }};border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;">{{ r.price }}</td>
              <td align="right" class="tr-ink{{ ' tr-tint' if r.zebra else '' }}" style="padding:9px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;background:{{ tint if r.zebra else 'transparent' }};border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;">{{ r.specs }}</td>
              <td align="right" class="tr-ink{{ ' tr-tint' if r.zebra else '' }}" style="padding:9px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;background:{{ tint if r.zebra else 'transparent' }};border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;">{{ r.sqft }}</td>
              <td align="right" class="tr-ink{{ ' tr-tint' if r.zebra else '' }}" style="padding:9px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;background:{{ tint if r.zebra else 'transparent' }};border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;">{{ r.dom }}</td>
            </tr>{% endfor %}
          </table></td></tr>
